lib/puppet_x/augeas/util/parser.rb
lib/puppet/feature/augeas.rb   (byte-identical to augeasproviders_core 4.2.0's)

Do not edit: TestFixturesMatchManifest requires each file's sha256 to equal the
digest in ../manifest.go.

augeas/traces/ holds the generic augeas type's recordings (06a-06r,
augeas-runtime-errors, augeas-notified, augeas-apply-ignores-libdir-lens),
recorded with trace.sh (tests/spine/augeas/trace/). Do not edit them.
